description: Practice
metadata:
  title: Testing
criterios:
  - codigo: local-1
    enunciado: Tests a boundary
    niveles: [Guided, Supported, Independent, Novel]
---
# Practice
Try a **boundary** case.</textarea><p id="skill-markdown-error" class="skills-field-error" role="alert"> </p></fieldset><div class="skills-secondary"><button type="button">Preview</button><button type="button">Discard draft</button></div><footer class="skills-save-bar"><div><p>Not assigned yet.</p><small>Changes apply to new sessions. Conversations in progress keep their content.</small></div><button type="submit" class="skills-primary">Save to library</button></footer></form></section>"
